WEBVTT

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:24.350
Yeah, we're about to load them onto the truck now.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.480
Yes, tomorrow, I promise.

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.260
What could be going on this early...?

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:57.760
Damn it... Huh...?

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.810
(In Russian) Hello.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:05.060
Wha...?

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:07.230
(In Russian) Goodbye.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:23.790
What kind of psycho uses a weapon you have to recover every time you use it?

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.120
Shut up, you idiot.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:29.090
Relax, she doesn't understand what we're saying.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:34.800
Hey, Major! Is it true that Russian women will sleep with any American guy?

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.760
Asshole.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.610
You may be ex-GRU, but now you're in it for the money.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:55.280
So what's the price for a night in your bed, eh?

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:57.610
Hey, cut it out!

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:02.370
Yes? What? OK...

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.080
Ms. Radinov!

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.790
It looks like the boss has another job for you.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.880
For an additional fee, of course.

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:16.990
Another hit?

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:59.320
"Thank you for calling Gunsmith Cats."

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.360
"We're unable to take your call at this time."

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:04.570
"Please leave a message at the sound of the beep."

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:12.080
Would you mind explaining why you dragged us all the way out here?

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:16.000
We're the ones who caught you, remember?

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:19.420
This is a bad place to try to get revenge, you know...

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:21.880
As far as we're concerned, your case is closed...

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:25.470
...so what did you hope to accomplish by making the ATF guys leave the room?

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:27.560
Ah, well... sorry about that...

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:29.810
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.850
Damn, he cut the microphone!

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:36.850
I'll get it.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.940
I'm not safe here! You gotta get me out!

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:45.100
And just where would you find a safer place?
You're in an ATF safe house!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:48.120
Washington, why isn't it safe here?

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:52.910
You don't understand... I know too much. I'm a sitting duck in here.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.450
That's why the ATF has five
agents out there at-

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:59.590
No, listen to me! You can't trust the ATF!

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:02.380
Washington, time's up.
Open the door!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.810
Get the spare key!

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:04.810
Right...

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:08.260
Washington! Open up! Washington!

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:13.100
Hold on... could you at least please take this watch? It's a Rolex.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:17.270
All I'm asking is for you to deliver this to my daughter. Here, I'll give you her address.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.230
Now wait a second! Why should I do...?

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:25.240
This is all I've got to pass on to her. Please, Rally!

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.240
Wait a second! We're not finished talking yet.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:29.660
No, I've heard enough.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.200
But...

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:32.750
Excuse me.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.620
Rally...

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.710
I was telling you the truth.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:46.180
You'll find out sooner or later. But
I won't be around when you do.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:06:01.360
After everything he's been through, this was all he had left... That's kinda sad.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:05.030
Sheesh! You're too soft, May.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.030
Why's that?

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:08.530
Because you took a job that won't pay.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:11.620
Oh, I didn't hear you raising any objections.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.870
That's not the point.

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:17.080
By the way, May, have you been practicing the new timings?

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:22.210
Huh? Yeah, I've been working on them.
I'm on the last song now.

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:24.170
Want to go over it?

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:24.170
Sure.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:25.420
Get ready... Huh?!

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:41.770
That punk bitch! I won't forget that face!

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:41.770
Rally...

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:47.030
Damn it! They dumped this extra shit on me.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.490
Aw, at least it kills time.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.780
Next up...

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:51.780
Huh?

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:53.950
The mayoral election is around the corner.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:57.040
State senator Edward Heinz declared his support for the total eradication...

00:06:57.040 --> 00:07:02.340
...of illegal weapons and drugs in a joint press conference with the ATF.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:08.340
We all know law-abiding citizens don't need these things.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:12.140
I'm just trying to promote some common-sense solutions.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.100
Where's the camera? Ah.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.350
Fellow citizens! I, Edward Heinz, promise you that...

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:20.770
...together with George Black of the ATF...

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:24.110
Heinz has been busily promoting his positive...

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.200
Well, the boss never misses a PR opportunity.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.870
Hey, are there any other visitors scheduled for today?

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:37.250
No, not that I know of.

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:55.390
Hey Bill, what's going on... Huh?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.640
Stop! I'm warning you!

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:25.380
Drop the gun!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:16.300
W... Wait! I know something about the organization.

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:18.470
Don't kill me! My people...

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:27.650
Man! Five agents down...

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.650
Looks like there <i>is</i> a spy in the ATF.

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.610
Hey, did you hear the rumors about Bill?

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.400
Hear what?

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.280
Can you explain this, Bill?

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:41.830
It's hard to believe that you...

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:45.580
What? Sir, you can't think that I...

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:48.040
Bill, you're off the case as of now!

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:51.000
But sir! You don't really think
I'm guilty, do you?

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.970
Someone is clearly trying to frame you.

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:56.430
So I need to handle it!

00:09:56.640 --> 00:10:02.640
Bill... this isn't a battlefield. Going it alone won't win you any medals.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.730
Understand?

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:08.770
Yes, sir...

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:41.260
Yes. This is a good time.

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:44.770
Yes, I eliminated the first target.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:48.100
I've already checked the intel on the next two.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.230
I must say, I'm surprised to learn of an American woman of such skill.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:58.490
Yes, I got it. Heroin sells for a very high price in Russia.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:02.910
By the way, I have received no data on the fourth target.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:08.710
I see... So, he will be surprised when his own partner has him killed.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:27.810
Are you sure this is the place?

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:30.270
Yeah, that's what the paper says.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:32.940
Well, I guess we'd better go see.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:35.730
I wonder how old his daughter is.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.940
Around 10 or so, I guess.

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:41.610
Number 6. This is it.

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.660
Good eve... Good eve...

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.870
What do you want?

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:52.790
Nothing... Nothing...

00:11:55.750 --> 00:12:01.260
A fake address and a fake Rolex... I wonder what he was really up to?

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.340
It's got to mean something.

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:07.640
That's not good enough, May. You got us into this, so it's on you to figure it out.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:10.350
Now hold on! This was as much your idea as mine... Ah!

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:14.190
Heh! Geez, May! Chill out!
I wasn't serious.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:17.650
Hey, Rally, that's my pop.
Give it back!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:19.690
Hey, Rally! Aaah!

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:27.450
Uh... May... are you all right?

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.790
I'm not talking to you. Huh?

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:38.550
In any case... it's pointless to keep thinking about this.

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:40.720
I guess we'd better drop it for now... right?

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:48.680
Working hard, eh? Please, have some...

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:50.890
Uh... well... I don't think I...

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.940
I don't need to hear your excuses, Bill.

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:56.440
Our business with you is over, right?

00:12:56.650 --> 00:13:00.650
If you've got time to bug my house <i>again</i>, you've got time to arrange that license you promised.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:05.870
This investigation isn't over yet, Rally.
I can't do it without your help, honest!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.120
Stop acting, it's pointless.

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:11.450
You're a fool if you think we would ever trust you!

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:17.380
Oh, that's cold. But you win, we're leaving.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:17.960
Yes, sir.

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:28.050
Did you have enough time to get it all set up, May?

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.350
Of course! Piece of cake!

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:32.020
Naturally...

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:33.390
I'm ready here.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.520
Roger.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.820
I should have known...

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:54.960
Damn!

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:08.510
The way to crack this is to figure out what these things really are.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:11.390
Could it be a phone number...? No...

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:15.730
It's not a bank account number, but it could be some sort of code...

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:18.190
Hrmmmmm...

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:22.730
Hey, did you notice anything strange the day you caught Washington?

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:24.030
Huh?

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:26.490
We did it.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:28.820
Yeah, our rhythm was perfect.

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:30.950
Are you even listening to me?

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:33.660
Ah! Sorry!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:38.420
But you might be right. Maybe there was a clue...

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.960
Oh...! He had internet access!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:46.340
He did? That's it!

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:50.140
I'll bet this is an internet address and access code!

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:52.640
Hey... there's something carved here!

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:53.550
What?

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:54.810
Look...

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.310
What's this number?

00:14:57.310 --> 00:14:58.560
Of course!

00:14:58.140 --> 00:14:58.560
Huh? Huh?

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:01.480
This is a secret code for a site on the network.

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:03.940
Watch carefully.

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:07.900
First, we enter the first letter of each word in the address, plus the phone number.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.830
That's it! That's the picture Washington had on his monitor!

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:16.790
Bingo! Now, we enter the number on the back of the watch.

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.290
Nailed it!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.880
That's incredible, Becky!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:28.090
What an idea... hiding data in a porn site.

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:30.470
But what kind of data is this?

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:34.140
Wait a second. Let me look at these dates...

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:35.770
Let's see...

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:39.560
Ah... The weapons they're selling were all previously seized by the ATF.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:43.360
Rally, you can sell this data for a very high price, but...

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:45.400
But first, we'll need proof.

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:46.780
Exactly.

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:49.070
May... ready to roll?

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:51.570
Absolutely!

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:52.660
Sounds good!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:56.370
Wait! Let me make some printouts!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:03.960
Heh... You print out there, and
I'll print out here, Miss Becky.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.630
Bill!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:09.590
How come you're still here? I don't want to hear that you're still...

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:16.600
No way! I'm writing up my reports. I've been putting them off for too long.

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:22.940
Well, all right... But remember, you're supposed to be assisting Frank! Understood?

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:26.440
Aye aye, sir!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.040
Is this the right place?

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:47.200
The shipment should have arrived here last night.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:49.900
Hey, let's do this tomorrow.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:51.960
You can't back out now!

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:54.140
Sorry, Becky, you'll have to stay here.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:57.220
Of course. I wouldn't come even if you asked.

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.220
Oh, I see.

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:08.690
Pretty serious security for a yacht club during the off-season.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.310
It's a good thing we left
Becky back in the car.

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:13.120
May...

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:15.780
Let's go.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:36.300
Wow, the mother lode!

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:36.300
Uh huh.

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:41.220
Hold it right there, you two...

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:43.310
The boss told us you'd be dropping by.

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:45.900
You two look pretty hot.

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:49.320
Come on over so we can get a good look at you.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:52.780
How about we take good care of you before we kill you?

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.900
Hey, hurry it up!

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:28.100
It's her...!

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:29.270
Shit...

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.110
Huh...?

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:35.360
Hey, that was cutting it a bit close...

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:39.910
Bill! Not you again! Sheesh!

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:59.260
What the hell are you doing here?

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:01.550
Well, was I even a bit helpful?

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:03.430
This might be another set-up!

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:05.890
Huh? That's a good one.

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:09.560
I happen to share your opinion about the trustworthiness of the ATF.

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:14.900
You tapped into our computer, didn't you? You snake!

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:16.860
May?!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:21.200
May!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.660
Rally, get in!

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:26.540
I'll drive!

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.250
Rally! Hey, take me with you! Rally!

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:29.790
Hey!

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:30.330
Let's <i>move</i>!

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.190
May, get the message!

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:08.700
<i>Rally! OK, time to bust a move!</i>

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:15.250
That's her! Music... start!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.800
One... Two... Three...

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:31.900
Get off of me!

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.070
You little bitch!

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:19.730
Rally, don't go crazy!

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:21.240
Tell that to her!

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:33.000
I won't let you go...!

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.420
Becky, can you see May?

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:44.760
Hold on... Huh...?!

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:48.180
Yikes!

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:12.240
That punk bitch...I won't forgive!

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:18.710
Becky, open the window!

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:26.840
Rally!

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:29.970
This ain't over yet!

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:41.020
Damn you!

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:48.240
One more verse. Then you're mine!

00:22:54.580 --> 00:22:56.540
Well, at least this makes it easier to shoot!

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:15.270
You're dead!

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:19.900
Bitch!

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:21.310
<i>Four...</i>

00:23:21.520 --> 00:23:22.440
<i>Three...</i>

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:23.320
<i>Two...</i>

00:23:23.320 --> 00:23:24.440
<i>One...</i>

00:23:24.440 --> 00:23:26.360
<i>Zero!</i>

00:23:32.450 --> 00:23:34.830
Oh... Shit!

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:39.670
Hah... Nice catch...

00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:42.500
Oooh! Are you totally insane?!

00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:44.710
Rally! Look!

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:04.110
May, just what did you do?

00:24:05.650 --> 00:24:07.070
Boy, that was quick!

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:09.700
Rally...

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:12.740
We did it again, May!

00:24:12.950 --> 00:24:15.620
But it's not over yet...

00:24:15.620 --> 00:24:16.990
Huh? Huh?

00:24:16.990 --> 00:24:19.210
There's more work to do...

00:24:19.410 --> 00:24:21.960
...before this business is over.

00:27:05.660 --> 00:27:07.670
Finally, it's time to get back to business as usual.

00:27:07.870 --> 00:27:09.960
Well, I guess I'll be going on a date with Ken...

00:27:10.170 --> 00:27:14.130
Hey, you two! You'd better not relax yet. Radinov's still alive!

00:27:14.340 --> 00:27:14.920
What?!

00:27:14.920 --> 00:27:18.010
What?! Oooh! I guess that ominous sense of foreboding was for real.

00:27:18.220 --> 00:27:21.800
We're in trouble, Rally! This whole incident's turning into a bottomless pit!

00:27:22.010 --> 00:27:26.770
The next episode of Gunsmith Cats!
Chapter 3! "High Speed Edge."

00:27:26.980 --> 00:27:29.900
If Radinov wants a one-on-one duel to the death, that's what she's going to get!
